  "remarks": "LLC Bank Round is a Moscow based Russian commercial bank. Metalloinvest Group, a major Russian mining and mettalurgy company fully owned by USM Holding is one of the bank’s customers. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, LLC Bank Round is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
